      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/sedalia_kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Situated at 36°38′38″N 88°36′18″W, Sedalia sits 505 feet above sea level, roughly seven miles south of Mayfield.",
